  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_st03",
  "title": "Trekking Upon Terra",
  "storyCode": "OD-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "855fb89636595d468fef535b8e62387814d01245613e778d20ff5fd06f556e7e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Half a month later"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "Thank you for all you've done, Cohen, Kötz, Tina, Alexsandr.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "On behalf of... The town of Long Spring...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "Sorry, I'm not so good with this kind of formal language.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "Thanks to you, I survived the conflict with my brother, and my people were able to return to live on their land.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "We were only doing what had to be done.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "We started this, so it's our responsibility to end it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "If it weren't for my irredeemable brother, none of this would've happened.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "I would have liked to offer you a reward.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "But, as you can see, our town has been destroyed.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "Anything we have left, I want used to rebuild Long Spring.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "A cash reward... is beyond my power to give you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "But anything you may want from this home is yours to take.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "I think we will have to tear it all down and build a new Long Spring with the survivors.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "About that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Alexsandr?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "text": "This helmet fits well. Can I keep it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "Uh huh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "Really, the nail tips are so blindingly bright, I'd like to put one on my shield so I don't need batteries anymore.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "That's enough for us. We're satisfied.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "That's... that's all?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "My weapons, my father's heirlooms, you can—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "No thanks. You need them more than we do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Let's go. We should leave now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Mister Kötz......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "You're finally done.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "text": "Did you say goodbye to the Lord?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "text": "Then it's time for us to go too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "My team will cover your return to Rhodes Island.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "Miss Cohen, your squad is coming with us, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Right. We've been fighting too long. We need a place to rest and resupply.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "And most importantly, we probably need some identities.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Identities we can go around the world with... around Terra.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "Sure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "The car's ready. We're off.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Human Resources Operator",
      "text": "Your information has been registered with Rhodes Island. You may stay and resupply at Rhodes Island field offices, or safehouses across Terra.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Human Resources Operator",
      "text": "Although you are not official employees of Rhodes Island, the mission network is open to you and you will be paid for contracts you complete.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Human Resources Operator",
      "text": "That's about it. Is there anything else you'd like to know?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "Just real quick, I have to ask, does Rhodes Island have any sci-fi literature?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Human Resources Operator",
      "text": "I'm sorry?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "text": "So these are our new identities.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "At least I've got a shield I can use. Could be worse.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "Do we have a plan?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Try to take a look at this world, which we now know too little about.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "I'd like to have a detailed writeup myself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "But this time, I'm sorry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "It's all up to us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "So where's our first destination?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Somewhere called Siesta. Sounds like a pretty good city.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "text": "Then let's get going.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "text": "Until we make it back home, we're on the road.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
